Package: com.lihaoyun6.oldweather
Name: Weather DGW for iOS 3
Version: 1.0.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Restores the stock Weather app on iPhone OS 3.x (armv6 and armv7). Fetches worldwide weather from Open-Meteo over plain HTTP and answers the app's DGW requests locally, including city search.
Maintainer: lihaoyun6
Author: lihaoyun6
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate
